  "instructions": [
    "Heat the butter in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook until fragrant.",
    "Add the fish and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the patis, vinegar, turmeric, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add 2 cups of water to the pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped green onions if desired."
